> But at what speed does your battery degrade and what is your current usage 
> pattern. When did you do the last full cycle? 

It was at 90-90% when I first got reliable readings (approx 1 month
after purchase). Now, 6 months and 89 cycles later, it is at 75%.

I do not have a fixed use pattern. Often it is connected to the
charger for most of the day, and used while discharging for a couple
of hours (approx. 20-25% of the charge).

